  - Rifts World Book 4: Africa, printed 67-69 (cache p068-p070, page offset
    +1). Printed 67 carries the introduction, 68 the whole stat block, 69 the
    Technology and Cybernetics paragraphs; the brief''s 67-70 runs one page too
