    lower bounds 0 / 1,826 / 3,451 / 6,901 / 13,801 / 19,201 / 29,201 /
    39,201 / 49,201 / 70,301 / 99,501 / 130,501 / 180,501 / 230,501 / 280,501.
    The book prints a ladder for the race and the R.C.C. is played on its own.
  - POOLS: M.D.C. 4D6x10 plus 10 per level, stored as mdc_base because the
    race prints its own skill list and takes no O.C.C.; it states no S.D.C.
    or hit points (an M.D.C. being). men_of_arms: false, as for every race.
    P.P.E. 2D4x10. Horror Factor 11. Average level of experience 1D4+2 is an
    NPC figure, not stored.
  - PSIONICS (judgement): the book splits the race by percentile - 10% Mind
    Melters, 5% Mind Bleeders, 85% master psionics. A variant cannot carry
    psionics (VARIANT_OVERRIDES), so, as with the Shaydor Spherian, the three
    types are three choosable abilities each carrying a complete psionics
    block, and there is no class-level block. The book says nothing more
    about the Mind Melter and Mind Bleeder crocodillians; their blocks copy
    the power ladders of the live mind-melter O.C.C. (its GM Notes schedule,
    with starting groups of three per category) and mind-bleeder O.C.C.
    (Psyscape) rows, but keep the race''s I.S.P. (3D4x10 plus 1D6+1 per level),
    which the book prints for the race as a whole. Psionic Empathy with
    Reptiles goes to the master type ONLY: printed 68 lists it among the
    abilities of "the remaining 85%", after naming the melters and bleeders. The three isp_base
    strings are worded differently only so none is byte-identical; they are
    the same formula.
  - MASTER TYPE: Hydrokinesis and P.P.E. Shield (both Super in the catalog)
    and Psionic Empathy with Reptiles (Special) granted by name; four
    Sensitive and two Healing picks; two Sensitive and one Healing at levels
    5 and 10.
  - COMBAT: natural predator, three attacks at level one (attacks_base 3),
    +1 at levels 3, 5, 9, 12 and 15. No Hand to Hand is printed and none is
    sold (hand_to_hand costs {}); Physical is excluded from secondaries. The
    natural weapon damages are a special ability.
  - BONUSES: +3 initiative, +2 strike, parry and dodge, +3 save vs horror
    factor, stored unconditionally. The doubling in water is conditional and
    is prose (Aquatic Combat Bonus). The +20% to ride crocodiles and large
    reptiles belongs to the empathy power''s text and is not stored.
  - SKILLS: the book prints the race''s own skill list with secondaries and
    names no O.C.C., so it is stored as the whole class. Basic math is
    Mathematics: Basic 45+10. Reads and speaks Dragonese (+20%) is Language:
    Dragonese 50+20 plus Literacy: Dragonese/Elven 30+20. Reads and speaks
    Euro (+10%) is Language: Euro 50+10 plus Literacy: Euro 30+10. Gobblely
    is Language: Gobblely 50+20. Ancient Egyptian has no catalog row: a fixed
    Language: Other at 50+20, per_level 0, as the Flying Tiger did. Track
    animals is Track & Trap Animals 20+10. Land Navigation 36+10. Water and
    underwater navigation ("same basic skill, different environment", +20%)
    is Navigation: Underwater 30+20 (judgement: one skill, the catalog''s
    underwater row). Wilderness Survival 30+20. Two Wilderness or Rogue
    skills (+5%), three Technical (+10%) and three W.P. are choice groups.
  - The natural swim 98%, climb 45% and prowl (30% land, 70% water) are also
    granted as Swimming, Climbing and Prowl at fixed percentages with no
    per-level gain (the Shaydor precedent); prowl is stored at the land
    figure. Track by blood scent 82% is a natural ability, not the Tracking
    skill.
  - SECONDARY: six, plus two each at levels 4 and 8, from any category
    except Electrical, Mechanical, Medical, Physical and Science.
  - No starting money and no equipment are printed; none stored. Technology
    (fascinated by it, 20% are competent computer operators and hackers,
    never manufacture anything) is lore.
  - Size about 20 feet long, 4 feet tall on all fours, 11 feet erect;
    1000-2000 lbs. Life span 300 years.
